# Four players: Wyrm's Crossing Patrol attacks Bot2, and its myriad makes a copy attacking each of Bot3 and Bot4 (CR 702.116a).
# Quina, Qu Gourmet makes that creation "those tokens plus a 1/1 green Frog" (CR 614.1a): each copy still attacks the opponent
# it was made for, and the Frog, made for no opponent, enters tapped and attacking what Bot1 chooses (CR 508.4; the Chatterfang
# rulings) - Bot3 here. Before the fix the tokens were shared out in creation order, so Bot4's copy went to Bot3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Quina, Qu Gourmet
Wyrm's Crossing Patrol
Island x16

